# ==============================================================================
# PROMISE OF PLANET - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
#
# INSTRUCTIONS FOR THE FOUNDER:
# 1. Do NOT commit actual configuration values to version control.
# 2. To configure local development, copy this file to '.env.local' or '.env' and populate the values.
# 3. For Vercel Beta hosting, set these as Environment Variables in the Vercel dashboard.
# 4. For production Firebase Hosting, configure these in the deployment/CI environment.
#
# ENVIRONMENT SEPARATION STRATEGY:
# - Development: Local execution against emulator or development project.
# - Beta: Hosted on Vercel, pointing to the designated Development/Staging/Production Firebase project.
# - Production: Hosted on Firebase Hosting, pointing to the authoritative production Firebase project.
# ==============================================================================

# Sole Authoritative Client-Side Runtime Firebase Configuration Keys:
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
